    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## 1. 张量（Tensor）基础\n",
    "\n",
    "张量是 PyTorch 的核心数据结构，类似于 NumPy 的多维数组，但支持 GPU 加速。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import torch\n",
    "\n",
    "# 查看 torch.tensor 的详细帮助文档\n",
    "# help(torch.tensor)   # 取消注释可查看完整说明书\n",
    "# print(dir(torch.tensor))  # 查看对象的所有属性和方法"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# ==================== 创建张量的多种方式 ====================\n",
    "import torch\n",
    "import numpy as np\n",
    "\n",
    "# ── 方式一：从零创建 ──\n",
    "a = torch.zeros(2, 3)       # 全 0 张量\n",
    "b = torch.ones(2, 3)        # 全 1 张量\n",
    "c = torch.randn(2, 3)       # 标准正态分布随机数\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"全 0 张量 a:\\n\", a)\n",
    "print(\"全 1 张量 b:\\n\", b)\n",
    "print(\"随机数张量 c:\\n\", c)\n",
    "print()\n",
    "\n",
    "# ── 方式二：从数据创建 ──\n",
    "t1 = torch.tensor(10)                           # 从标量\n",
    "t2 = torch.tensor([[1, 2], [3, 4]])              # 从列表\n",
    "t3 = torch.from_numpy(np.array([[1, 2], [3, 4]])) # 从 NumPy（共享内存）\n",
    "t4 = torch.from_numpy(np.random.randint(0, 10, (2, 3)))  # 从 NumPy 随机数\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"从标量创建:\", t1, \"形状:\", t1.shape)\n",
    "print(\"从列表创建:\\n\", t2, \"形状:\", t2.shape)\n",
    "print(\"从 NumPy 创建:\\n\", t3, \"形状:\", t3.shape)\n",
    "print(\"从 NumPy 随机数创建:\\n\", t4, \"形状:\", t4.shape)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "**创建张量速查**：\n",
    "\n",
    "| 方法 | 说明 | 示例 |\n",
    "|------|------|------|\n",
    "| `torch.zeros(m, n)` | 全 0 张量 | `torch.zeros(2, 3)` |\n",
    "| `torch.ones(m, n)` | 全 1 张量 | `torch.ones(2, 3)` |\n",
    "| `torch.randn(m, n)` | 随机正态分布 | `torch.randn(2, 3)` |\n",
    "| `torch.tensor(data)` | 从 Python 数据 | `torch.tensor([1, 2, 3])` |\n",
    "| `torch.from_numpy(arr)` | 从 NumPy（共享内存） | `torch.from_numpy(np_arr)` |\n",
    "| `torch.rand(m, n)` | [0,1) 均匀分布 | `torch.rand(2, 3)` |"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## 2. 张量操作\n",
    "\n",
    "包括加减乘除、转置、形状变换等基本操作。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# ==================== 张量的基本操作 ====================\n",
    "import torch\n",
    "\n",
    "e = torch.randn(2, 3)\n",
    "f = torch.randn(2, 3)\n",
    "\n",
    "# 1. 加法（逐元素相加）\n",
    "print(\"e + f:\\n\", e + f)\n",
    "\n",
    "# 2. 逐元素乘法（不是矩阵乘法！）\n",
    "print(\"e * f (逐元素相乘):\\n\", e * f)\n",
    "\n",
    "# 3. 矩阵乘法\n",
    "g = torch.randn(3, 2)\n",
    "print(\"e @ g (矩阵乘法):\\n\", e @ g)  # 等价于 torch.matmul(e, g)\n",
    "\n",
    "# 4. 转置\n",
    "print(\"g.T (转置):\\n\", g.T)  # 等价于 g.transpose(0, 1)\n",
    "\n",
    "# 5. 形状\n",
    "print(\"g 的形状:\", g.shape)  # torch.Size([3, 2])"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## 3. 自动求导（Autograd）\n",
    "\n",
    "PyTorch 的自动微分机制是神经网络训练的核心。通过 `requires_grad=True` 标记需要求导的张量，调用 `.backward()` 自动计算梯度。\n",
    "\n",
    "### 3.1 简单梯度计算"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# y = 2x, 求 dy/dx\n",
    "x = torch.tensor([1.0], requires_grad=True)\n",
    "y = x * 2\n",
    "y.backward()  # 反向传播\n",
    "print(f\"x = {x.item()}, y = 2x = {y.item()}, dy/dx = {x.grad.item()}\")\n",
    "# 输出: dy/dx = 2.0（符合预期）"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# ==================== 稍复杂的梯度计算 ====================\n",
    "# y = (x + 2)^2 * 3, out = mean(y), 求 d(out)/dx\n",
    "x = torch.randn(2, 2, requires_grad=True)\n",
    "print(\"x:\\n\", x)\n",
    "\n",
    "y = x + 2\n",
    "z = y * y * 3\n",
    "out = z.mean()\n",
    "print(\"\\n计算结果 out:\", out.item())\n",
    "\n",
    "out.backward()\n",
    "print(\"\\nx 的梯度 (d(out)/dx):\\n\", x.grad)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "**自动求导要点**：\n",
    "- `requires_grad=True`: 标记张量，启用梯度追踪\n",
    "- `.backward()`: 反向传播，自动计算所有标记张量的梯度\n",
    - `.grad`: 访问计算得到的梯度\n",
    "- `.grad.zero_()` 或 `optimizer.zero_grad()`: 清零梯度（训练时必需）"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## 4. TensorBoard 可视化\n",
    "\n",
    "TensorBoard 是 PyTorch 自带的可视化工具，用于监控训练过程中的标量、图像、计算图等数据。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# ==================== TensorBoard 基础使用 ====================\n",
    "# 运行步骤：\n",
    "#   1. 执行下方代码生成日志\n",
    "#   2. 终端运行: tensorboard --logdir logs_new\n",
    "#   3. 浏览器打开: http://localhost:6006\n",
    "\n",
    "import os\n",
    "from torch.utils.tensorboard import SummaryWriter\n",
    "import numpy as np\n",
    "\n",
    "log_dir = os.path.abspath(\"logs_new\")\n",
    "print(f\"日志目录: {log_dir}\")\n",
    "\n",
    "writer = SummaryWriter(log_dir)\n",
    "\n",
    "# 添加图像（随机 3x100x100）\n",
    "writer.add_image(\"demo_image\", np.random.rand(3, 100, 100), 1)\n",
    "\n",
    "# 添加标量（模拟训练损失曲线）\n",
    "for i in range(100):\n",
    "    writer.add_scalar(\"train/loss\", 1.0 / (i + 1), i)\n",
    "    writer.add_scalar(\"train/accuracy\", i / 100, i)\n",
    "\n",
    "writer.close()\n",
    "print(\"✅ 日志写入完成。运行: tensorboard --logdir logs_new\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
